Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/520#issuecomment-3988165293","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORGgqa87tuhjV","author":{"login":"createkr"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Bounty submission for Rustchain bug #524: we reproduced the clawrtc wallet show failure with request-level tracing and confirmed endpoint mismatch. Evidence: GET /api/balance?wallet=<address> returns 404, while GET /wallet/balance?miner_id=<address> returns 200 with valid balance JSON for the same RTC address. We posted technical details and fix path in Rustchain issue #524 comments. Please record this as bug-report/fix contribution for payout. Payout wallet: RTC1d48d848a5aa5ecf2c5f01aa5fb64837daaf2f35.","createdAt":"2026-03-03T03:23:19Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/520#issuecomment-3988396245","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORGgqa87tvFC_","author":{"login":"edisonlv"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Bug Hunter claim\\n\\nFiled a reproducible bug in Scottcjn/bounty-concierge:\\n- Issue: https://github.com/Scottcjn/bounty-concierge/issues/13\\n- Bug: README quickstart references unsupported CLI commands (, )\\n- Includes repro steps + environment\\n\\nRTC wallet: claw","createdAt":"2026-03-03T04:14:09Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/520#issuecomment-3988541631","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORGgqa87tvFU0","author":{"login":"edisonlv"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Correction for clarity: unsupported commands are 'concierge show' and 'concierge repos'. See bug issue: https://github.com/Scottcjn/bounty-concierge/issues/13  | wallet: claw","createdAt":"2026-03-03T04:14:31Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMini